      "id": "claim_487b3b2b4cd041df9aa739ab41d45d1a",
      "statement": "cybflight structures task execution across a three-tier priority hierarchy using Embassy executors: high-priority DShot motor output runs at NVIC priority P6 (EXECUTOR_HIGH), inner control tasks (IMU readers, 8 kHz INDI controller, failsafe, RC parsers) run at NVIC priority P10 (EXECUTOR_CTRL), and compute-heavy algorithms (MPC SQP outer loop, ESKF estimation, trajectory planning) run on the thread executor so heavy solvers cannot delay the inner control loop or motor output.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/cybflight/src/main.rs#L147-L167",
